    "redwine": "\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h2>RED WINE</h2>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">酩颂酒庄干红葡萄酒 <span class=\"en-name\">Château · Mongiron Rouge</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥800 /1瓶 - ¥1800 /3瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">瑞恩酒园勃艮第山丘红葡萄酒 <span class=\"en-name\">Domaine Régnard · Bourgogne Pinot Noir</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥1200 /1瓶 - ¥3200 /3瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">澳宝庄园丝绒礼炮希拉红葡萄酒 <span class=\"en-name\">Opal Estate Velvet Salute Shiraz</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥1300 /1瓶 - ¥3500 /3瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">博若济贫院庄园勃艮第佳美干红葡萄酒 <span class=\"en-name\">Hospices de Beaujeu Bourgogne Gamay</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥1500 /瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">格兰苏赤霞珠1L <span class=\"en-name\">Grand Sud Cabernet Sauvignon 1L</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥1800 /瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">西班牙豪酒干红葡萄酒 <span class=\"en-name\">Hao Spanish Tinto Red Wine</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥2000 /瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">布夏父子首席黑皮诺红葡萄酒 <span class=\"en-name\">Bouchard Aîné & · Fils Bourgogne Pinot Noir</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥2200 /瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">博若济贫院庄园朱丽娜佳美干红葡萄酒 <span class=\"en-name\">Hospices de Beaujeu Juliénas</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥2200 /瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">吉诺托斯卡纳红葡萄酒 <span class=\"en-name\">Barbanera \"Gigino\" · Toscana Rosso IGT</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥3000 /瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">宝尚酒园哲维瑞‑香贝丹红葡萄酒 <span class=\"en-name\">Bouchard Père & Fils Gevrey‑Chambertin</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥8000 /瓶</div></di